    "detailed_description": "NOISZ fuses music game and shoot-em-up elements to create a frantic new experience that demands lightning reflexes, keen sense of rhythm, and judicious decision making!<br><br>Even shmup and rhythm game veterans will find there\u2019s still a lot to learn... but intuitive core gameplay will ensure that everyone\u2019s quickly blasting away to the beat!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681530/extras/9f57161801de10a799184d21d3f32258.avif?t=1753122964\" /></div><br><br>Featuring a lineup of 16 hard-hitting tracks, challenging boss fights with unique mechanics in each stage, deep and fun scoring mechanics that provide tens of hours of intense gameplay, several gameplay styles that you can choose between to suit the situation or your personal preference, a story in full-fledged visual novel form packed with colorful characters and surprising twists, and even dance pad support--NOISZ fuses its component genres to become unlike anything else you've ever played!",
    "about_the_game": "NOISZ fuses music game and shoot-em-up elements to create a frantic new experience that demands lightning reflexes, keen sense of rhythm, and judicious decision making!<br><br>Even shmup and rhythm game veterans will find there\u2019s still a lot to learn... but intuitive core gameplay will ensure that everyone\u2019s quickly blasting away to the beat!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/681530/extras/9f57161801de10a799184d21d3f32258.avif?t=1753122964\" /></div><br><br>Featuring a lineup of 16 hard-hitting tracks, challenging boss fights with unique mechanics in each stage, deep and fun scoring mechanics that provide tens of hours of intense gameplay, several gameplay styles that you can choose between to suit the situation or your personal preference, a story in full-fledged visual novel form packed with colorful characters and surprising twists, and even dance pad support--NOISZ fuses its component genres to become unlike anything else you've ever played!",
    "short_description": "NOISZ is an unprecedented mix of rhythm game, bullet hell shoot-em-up, and visual novel. Battle a variety of challenging and unique bosses by performing actions to the beat, in order to progress through a massive anime-inspired narrative full of surprising twists and colorful characters!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cNOISZ\u2019 sound design and music are fantastic... balances shmup gameplay and music-game mechanics in a manner that appeals to fans of both genres.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 bemanistyle<br><br>\u201cNOISZ blends the fury of shooting games with the technical prowess of rhythm games. Whether you play it on a controller or a dance pad, this game tests your skills.\u201d<br>AXS<br><br>\u201cOne of those things you never knew you would want in life... NOISZ is a challenging game that I couldn\u2019t get enough of.\u201d<br>Nerdier Tides<br>",
